Task: Threshold sweep test (Phase 4, cmc-2d_20261025)

Sweeps a shared QoS threshold from 0.2 to 0.9 over the app1/app2 direct
conflict and asserts:

- n_satisfied_after is monotonically non-increasing as thresholds tighten.
- The loosest threshold satisfies more xApps than the strictest.
- MitigationResult.improved() is exactly (after >= before) at every point.

Files:
- tests/test_synthetic.py

Why: pins the QoS trade-off reported to the user and the contract of the
improved() flag used by print_cmc_report.
